            "title": "Request One Course",
            "id": 152245,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Abbiamo usato i parametri di query per filtrare i dati restituiti da un'API.</p><p>I parametri di percorso sono un'altra opzione. Aggiungono anch'essi valori a un URL, ma ci aiutano a raggiungere direttamente una risorsa specifica.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url_with_query_parameters = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?id=1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url_with_route_parameters = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses/1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Read a Route Pattern",
            "id": 152246,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un pattern di route come <code>/courses/1</code> include direttamente l'ID della risorsa nel percorso dell'URL.</p><p>Completa il codice per aggiungere il parametro della route.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"route_pattern = \" /><text value=\"&quot;/courses/1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"?\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>/</code>, seguito da <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Add the Route Value",
            "id": 152247,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il valore della route segue il nome della risorsa e una barra.</p><p>Aggiungi <code>/12</code> per richiedere il corso con ID <code>12</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses/12&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"?id=12\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"34\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>/</code>, seguito da <code>12</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Send the Course Request",
            "id": 152248,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una volta costruito l'URL, incluso il parametro della route, possiamo usarlo per effettuare la richiesta API.</p><p>Passa l'URL completa a <code>requests.get()</code> per inviare la richiesta.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://api.example.com/courses/12&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"58\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>/</code>, seguito da <code>12</code> e infine <code>url</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una volta costruito l'URL, incluso il parametro della route, possiamo usarlo per effettuare la richiesta API.</p><p>Recupera il corso con ID <code>12</code> usando un parametro della route e passa l'<code>url</code> completo alla richiesta.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://api.example.com/courses/12&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"?id=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"8\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"post\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>/</code>, seguito da <code>12</code>, <code>get</code> e infine <code>url</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 152264,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa la variabile <code>certificate_id</code> come parametro della route per richiedere un certificato specifico.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"certificate_id = \" /><text value=\"37631\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;https://mimo.org/certificates/\" /><text value=\"{certificate_id}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"94\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;id&quot;: 37631,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;learner_id&quot;: 14689122\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;course&quot;: &quot;Python&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;status&quot;: &quot;completed&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>{</code>, seguito da <code>certificate_id</code> e infine <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
