            "id": 152254,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il nome della risorsa annidata segue il valore del corso.</p><p>Completa il codice per assicurarti che il numero <code>12</code> venga usato come ID del corso e il numero <code>4</code> come ID della lezione nell'URL.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"course = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lesson = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;https://mimo.org/courses/\" /><text value=\"{course}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"/lessons/\" /><text value=\"{lesson}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"89\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;id&quot;: 4,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Working with APIs&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;course_id&quot;: 12\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>courses</code>, seguito da <code>lessons</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il nome della risorsa annidata segue il valore del corso.</p><p>Completa il codice per assicurarti che il numero <code>12</code> venga usato come ID del corso e il numero <code>4</code> come ID della lezione nell'URL.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"course = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lesson = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;https://mimo.org/courses/\" /><text value=\"{course}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"/lessons/\" /><text value=\"{lesson}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"users\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"certificates\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;id&quot;: 4,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Working with APIs&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;course_id&quot;: 12\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>courses</code>, seguito da <code>course</code>, <code>lessons</code> e infine <code>lesson</code>.</p></body></html>",
